IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sgb2-s173a-s173c-information-duties`

-- Tests for ss 173A, 173B, 173C and 173H. Every expected value is written from the text, beside the assertion, before it was run.

§ `s 173A: the company's notices to the Registrar`

-- (a): the person became a director on 1 June 2026; the 14th day is 15 June.
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(a) the company furnished the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(a) the company furnished the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(a) the company furnished the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b)
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(b) the company furnished the particulars of the change in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(b) the company furnished the particulars of the change in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(b) the company furnished the particulars of the change in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (c)
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(c) the company furnished the particulars of the change in the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(c) the company furnished the particulars of the change in the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(c) the company furnished the particulars of the change in the information in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (d): all three items, and in time.
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(1)(d) the company furnished the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified in time` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- (a) as a rule: in 14 days FULFILLED; in 15 BREACH; nothing yet RESIDUAL.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(a) the company must furnish the Registrar with the information within 14 days after a person becomes a director, chief executive officer, secretary or auditor` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(a) furnish the Registrar by notice with the information required under section 173(3), (5), (6) or (7) for the person who has become a director, chief executive officer, secretary or auditor` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(a) the company must furnish the Registrar with the information within 14 days after a person becomes a director, chief executive officer, secretary or auditor` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(a) furnish the Registrar by notice with the information required under section 173(3), (5), (6) or (7) for the person who has become a director, chief executive officer, secretary or auditor` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(a) the company must furnish the Registrar with the information within 14 days after a person becomes a director, chief executive officer, secretary or auditor` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

