-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(b) the company must furnish the Registrar with the particulars of the change within 14 days after a change in an appointment` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(b) furnish the Registrar by notice with the particulars of the change in the information resulting from the change in the appointment` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(b) the company must furnish the Registrar with the particulars of the change within 14 days after a change in an appointment` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- (c) as a rule: in 14 days FULFILLED; in 15 BREACH; nothing yet RESIDUAL.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(c) the company must furnish the Registrar with the particulars of a change in the information within 14 days after the change` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(c) furnish the Registrar by notice with the particulars of the change in the information` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(c) the company must furnish the Registrar with the particulars of a change in the information within 14 days after the change` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
