-- (d) as a rule: in 14 days FULFILLED; in 15 BREACH; nothing yet RESIDUAL.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(d) the company must furnish the Registrar with the information within 14 days after it becomes aware that a person has ceased to be qualified to act as a director` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(d) furnish the Registrar by notice with the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified to act as a director` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
