    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173A(1)(d) furnish the Registrar by notice with the information about the person's ceasing to be qualified to act as a director` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173A(1)(d) the company must furnish the Registrar with the information within 14 days after it becomes aware that a person has ceased to be qualified to act as a director` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

-- (3): the prescribed form if there is one, else the form the Registrar determines.
#ASSERT `s 173A(3) the notice is in the form the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(3) the notice is in the form the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173A(3) the notice is in the form the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173A(3) the notice is in the form the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 173B: the duty to tell the company`

-- (1)(a): previously given in writing: the requirement is lifted. Otherwise as soon as practicable and within 14 days of the initial appointment (1 June 2026: 15 June).
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(a) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` TRUE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 30 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(a) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(a) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(a) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` FALSE (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(b) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(b) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173B(1)(b) the person has met the requirement to give the company the information` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173B(2) the person must provide the information referred to in section 173(3), (5), (6) or (7)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173B(2) the person must provide the information referred to in section 173(3), (5), (6) or (7)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 173B(3) the person has met the requirement to furnish the information on request` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173B(3) the person has met the requirement to furnish the information on request` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 16 6 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173B(3) the person has met the requirement to furnish the information on request` (Date 1 6 2026) (Date 15 6 2026) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(a) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after the initial appointment` "Dana Tan" FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(1)(a) give the company the information it needs to comply with section 173A(1)(a)` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(a) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after the initial appointment` "Dana Tan" FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(1)(a) give the company the information it needs to comply with section 173A(1)(a)` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(a) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after the initial appointment` "Dana Tan" FALSE AT 0 WITH

-- Previously given in writing: nothing is owed.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(a) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after the initial appointment` "Dana Tan" TRUE AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(b) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after a change to the information` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(1)(b) give the company the information it needs to comply with section 173A(1)(b) or (c)` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(b) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after a change to the information` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(1)(b) give the company the information it needs to comply with section 173A(1)(b) or (c)` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173B(1)(b) the person must give the company the information within 14 days after a change to the information` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH

-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173B(3) the person must furnish the information to the company within 14 days after receipt of its written request` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(3) furnish the information to the company on its written request` AT 14

-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 173B(3) the person must furnish the information to the company within 14 days after receipt of its written request` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Individual "Dana Tan" DOES `s 173B(3) furnish the information to the company on its written request` AT 15

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173B(3) the person must furnish the information to the company within 14 days after receipt of its written request` "Dana Tan" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 173C: the consents the company keeps`

#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(i) a signed copy of the director's consent to act as director` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(i) a signed copy of the director's consent to act as director` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(ii) a statement that the director is not disqualified to act as director under this Act or under any other written law` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(ii) a statement that the director is not disqualified to act as director under this Act or under any other written law` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(b) a signed copy of the secretary's consent to act as secretary` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(b) a signed copy of the secretary's consent to act as secretary` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (iii): documentary evidence "(if any)": with none to keep, nothing is owed.
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(iii) documentary evidence (if any) of any change in the director's name` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(iii) documentary evidence (if any) of any change in the director's name` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C(a)(iii) documentary evidence (if any) of any change in the director's name` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173C the company has kept the item at its registered office` `s 173C some other item` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- No period: done, FULFILLED; not done, RESIDUAL; never BREACH.
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 173C the company must keep at its registered office the consents, statements and evidence` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Pte Ltd" DOES `s 173C keep at its registered office the signed copy of each director's consent, the statement of non-disqualification, any documentary evidence of a change in name, and the signed copy of each secretary's consent` AT 1

-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 173C the company must keep at its registered office the consents, statements and evidence` "Acme Pte Ltd" AT 0 WITH

§ `s 173H: penalties`

#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST (`s 173H penalty` OF 5000, TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 173H penalty` OF 5000, TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 173H(1) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 173H(2) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 173H(2) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 173H(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`s 173H penalty` OF 5000, TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 173H(2) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
